sops.workflow:
1. User -> Transportation Planner;
2. Transportation Planner -> Accommodation Planner;
3. Accommodation Planner -> Restaurant Planner
   Accommodation Planner -> Attractions Planner (in parallel);
4. Restaurant Planner, Attractions Planner -> Final Plan Summarizer;
5. Final Plan Summarizer -> End.

Description:
First, the Transportation Planner determines the self-driving route between Evansville and two Texas cities while ensuring a closed-loop itinerary. This framework is passed to the Accommodation Planner to secure child-friendly private rooms. Simultaneously, the Restaurant and Attractions Planners arrange non-repeating meals and activities matching daily locations. The Final Plan Summarizer validates all components against user constraints (no flights, child policies, budget) before delivering the complete itinerary.
